<br>
The first row shows that supplementary heat adds \( {@lightn_heats@} - {@lightn_heatn@} = {@heat_diff@}\).
<br>
Therefore, with no interaction, we can expect the same addition with supplementary light i.e. \({@lights_heatn@} + {@heat_diff@} = {@ta1@}\).]]></text>
